<%# A personal best, never a comparison with anyone else.

    Earnings here come from grades and attendance, so ranking students would publish their school
    record to their classmates. Against their own history it is encouragement.

    Withheld until a student has earned something, so it never reads "best month: $0.00".

    This renders components/ui/_stat. It used to hand-write the same card: identical label, figure
    and hint tokens, plus a tile hung off the right in an `items-start justify-between` row - so it
    mirrored money_at_work, which sits beside it in the same grid row with its tile on the left. Two
    copies of one card is also how the tile sizes drifted; this one was 36px against the home page's
    32px. %>
<% return if @insights.best_month_cents.nil? %>

<%= render "components/ui/stat",
           testid: "best-month",
           icon: "trophy",
           icon_tone: :warning,
           label: "Best month yet",
           value: number_to_currency(@insights.best_month_cents / 100.0),
           hint: "#{@insights.best_month_date.strftime('%B %Y')} - your biggest month of earnings" %>
